--- failures under none ---
--- q09 [medium]
  Q:    Which employees earn more than the average salary across the company?
  why:  same row count, different values
  got:  SELECT e.name, e.salary FROM employees AS e WHERE e.salary > ( SELECT AVG(salary) FROM employees ) LIMIT 500
  gold: SELECT name FROM employees WHERE salary > (SELECT AVG(salary) FROM employees)

--- h02 [hard] trap=anti-join
  Q:    Which employees have never handled an order?
  why:  query failed: no such column: oi.employee_id
  got:  SELECT e.name FROM employees e LEFT JOIN order_items oi ON e.id = oi.employee_id WHERE oi.id IS NULL
  gold: SELECT e.name FROM employees e WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.employee_id = e.id)


